{"3947220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deckaroo", "steam_appid": 3947220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique heroes and build a deck of 15 monsters, ranked from 1★ to 5★, to destroy your opponent’s towers first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own strategy using powerful heroes and 3★–5★ monsters, each equipped with their own special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck will be loaded randomly into the selection window, keeping every match fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy units with your allied monsters to collect mana and summon more from your deck. At the same time, charge your hero gauge to join the battlefield yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your hero gauge reaches 100%, dive into the fight alongside your monsters and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your opponent’s defenses, destroy more towers, and claim victory!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique heroes and build a deck of 15 monsters, ranked from 1★ to 5★, to destroy your opponent’s towers first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own strategy using powerful heroes and 3★–5★ monsters, each equipped with their own special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck will be loaded randomly into the selection window, keeping every match fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy units with your allied monsters to collect mana and summon more from your deck. At the same time, charge your hero gauge to join the battlefield yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your hero gauge reaches 100%, dive into the fight alongside your monsters and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your opponent’s defenses, destroy more towers, and claim victory!</p>", "short_description": "Build your deck of